WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.341
Unit nine. Lungs and Breathing!

2
00:00:04.305 --> 00:00:08.022
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.072 --> 00:00:11.467
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.518 --> 00:00:15.376
Today we learn about Lungs and Breathing. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.172 --> 00:00:19.639
Lungs. Say it with me. Lungs!

6
00:00:23.132 --> 00:00:26.599
Breathe. Say it with me. Breathe!

7
00:00:30.109 --> 00:00:33.642
Oxygen. Say it with me. Oxygen!

8
00:00:37.132 --> 00:00:40.299
Air. Say it with me. Air!

9
00:00:43.799 --> 00:00:47.465
Smoke. Say it with me. Smoke!

10
00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:55.084
Exercise. Say it with me. Exercise!

11
00:00:58.588 --> 00:01:02.038
Chest. Say it with me. Chest!

12
00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:09.036
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

13
00:01:12.552 --> 00:01:21.592
When I breathe in, air fills my lungs and my body takes in oxygen. Smoke and dirty air can harm my lungs. Exercise helps my lungs and chest stay strong.

14
00:01:21.642 --> 00:01:22.884
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:29.767
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.817 --> 00:01:30.967
Oxygen!

17
00:01:32.049 --> 00:01:37.244
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.294 --> 00:01:38.444
Chest!

19
00:01:39.322 --> 00:01:46.222
Did you know? Your lungs are not the same size — the left one is a little smaller to make room for your heart!

20
00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:48.219
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.111 --> 00:01:56.254
Think and answer. What can harm your lungs?

22
00:01:56.304 --> 00:01:57.454
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.689 --> 00:02:03.326
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.376 --> 00:02:06.078
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

